  "answer": "I found no past ticket that reports this same proposal. The archive has related tickets, but each covers only one piece of it. #46275 reports the Command Palette dock slightly overlapping app windows, and it was closed as a duplicate of #46849. #48934 is about network send/receive in the dock performance monitor. #47437 asks for battery information on the dock. #49010 asks for drill-down detail when you click the monitor widgets. Please file this as a new feature request. It would help to split it into separate requests: (1) combine the CPU, memory, network and GPU widgets into one monitor button with a flyout, (2) show a charging indicator on the battery widget, and (3) fix the dock overlap. For the overlap bug, add your PowerToys version and dock position to #46275 or #46849."
 },
